<div class="smoke-levelup-inner">
  <header class="lv-head">
    <div><span class="kicker">REP {{info.level}} · {{info.title}} → REP {{plan.to}}</span><h2>{{#if top}}Already a Legend{{else}}{{actor.name}}, {{nextTitle}}{{/if}}</h2><p>{{nextBlurb}}</p></div>
    <div class="lv-xp"><b>{{info.xp}}</b><small>XP{{#if info.next}} / {{info.next}}{{/if}}</small></div>
  </header>
  <main class="lv-main">
    {{#if top}}<p class="lv-lead">Rep 5 is the top. There is nothing left to prove — only to lose.</p>
    {{else}}{{#unless enoughXP}}<p class="lv-warn"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i> Rep {{plan.to}} needs {{info.next}} XP; {{actor.name}} has {{info.xp}}. Jobs, Pat's orders and missions earn XP (the GM can award it too).</p>{{/unless}}
    <h3><b>1</b> Raise a stat <small>(up to d{{plan.cap}} at Rep {{plan.to}})</small></h3>
    <div class="lv-stats">{{#each stats}}<button type="button" data-lv-stat="{{key}}" class="{{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}" {{#unless ok}}disabled{{/unless}}><b>{{abbr}}</b><span>{{label}}</span><small>d{{die}}{{#if next}} → d{{next}}{{/if}}</small></button>{{/each}}</div>
    <h3><b>2</b> A new perk</h3>
    <div class="lv-perks">{{#each perks}}<button type="button" data-lv-perk="{{name}}" class="{{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}"><b>{{name}}</b><small>{{abbr}} · {{when}}</small></button>{{/each}}</div>
    <h3><b>3</b> Growth</h3>
    <p class="lv-lead">Roll your Grit die for Health (gain half, rounded up) and the better of Moves or Grit for Guard (3+ gains 1, the top face gains 2). Raising Grit or Moves first makes these rolls bigger.</p>
    {{#if growth}}<div class="lv-growth"><span>Health <b>+{{growth.health}}</b> <small>rolled {{growth.healthRoll}} on d{{growth.healthDie}}</small></span><span>Guard <b>+{{growth.guard}}</b> <small>rolled {{growth.guardRoll}} on d{{growth.guardDie}}</small></span>{{#if plan.hustle}}<span>Hustle <b>+1</b></span>{{/if}}</div>
    {{else}}<button type="button" class="lv-roll" data-lv-growth><i class="fa-solid fa-dice"></i> Roll Growth</button>{{/if}}
    {{/if}}
  </main>
  {{#unless top}}<footer class="lv-foot">{{#if problem}}<span class="lv-problem">{{problem}}</span>{{else}}<span></span>{{/if}}<button type="button" class="hot" data-lv-confirm {{#unless ready}}disabled{{/unless}}><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-trend-up"></i> Level up to Rep {{plan.to}}</button></footer>{{/unless}}
</div>
